{"status":"ready","content":"## Setting Up the Calculation\n\n**Data set:** {25, 10, 0, 9, -1, -14, -21}\n\n**n = 7**\n\n## Step 1: Calculate the Mean\n\n$$\\bar{x} = \\frac{25 + 10 + 0 + 9 + (-1) + (-14) + (-21)}{7} = \\frac{8}{7} \\approx 1.143$$\n\n## Step 2: Calculate Deviations from Mean\n\n| $x_i$ | $x_i - \\bar{x}$ | $(x_i - \\bar{x})^2$ |\n|--------|-----------------|---------------------|\n| 25 | $25 - \\frac{8}{7} = \\frac{167}{7}$ | $\\frac{27889}{49}$ |\n| 10 | $10 - \\frac{8}{7} = \\frac{62}{7}$ | $\\frac{3844}{49}$ |\n| 0 | $0 - \\frac{8}{7} = -\\frac{8}{7}$ | $\\frac{64}{49}$ |\n| 9 | $9 - \\frac{8}{7} = \\frac{55}{7}$ | $\\frac{3025}{49}$ |\n| -1 | $-1 - \\frac{8}{7} = -\\frac{15}{7}$ | $\\frac{225}{49}$ |\n| -14 | $-14 - \\frac{8}{7} = -\\frac{106}{7}$ | $\\frac{11236}{49}$ |\n| -21 | $-21 - \\frac{8}{7} = -\\frac{155}{7}$ | $\\frac{24025}{49}$ |\n\n## Step 3: Sum of Squared Deviations\n\n$$\\sum(x_i - \\bar{x})^2 = \\frac{27889 + 3844 + 64 + 3025 + 225 + 11236 + 24025}{49} = \\frac{70308}{49}$$\n\n## Step 4: Sample Variance\n\n$$s^2 = \\frac{\\sum(x_i - \\bar{x})^2}{n-1} = \\frac{70308/49}{6} = \\frac{70308}{294} = \\frac{11718}{49}$$\n\n## Step 5: Sample Standard Deviation\n\n$$s = \\sqrt{\\frac{11718}{49}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{11718}}{7}$$\n\nSimplifying $\\sqrt{11718}$: $11718 = 2 \\times 3 \\times 1953 = 2 \\times 3 \\times 3 \\times 651 = 2 \\times 9 \\times 651 = 18 \\times 651$\n\n$$s = \\frac{\\sqrt{18 \\times 651}}{7} = \\frac{3\\sqrt{2 \\times 651}}{7} = \\frac{3\\sqrt{1302}}{7}$$\n\n$$\\boxed{\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{1302}}{7}}$$\n","metadata":{"modelLabel":"Claude Sonnet 4.6","modelId":"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6","promptId":"365-LiveBench-Math","request":{"maxOutputTokens":5000,"reasoning":{"effort":null,"exclude":null}},"response":{"id":"gen-1779367865-p7vWd0hSl1BcAqKB7RxU","model":"anthropic/claude-4.6-sonnet-20260217","finishReason":"stop","nativeFinishReason":"end_turn","reasoningReturned":false},"usage":{"completion_tokens":796,"prompt_tokens"